#: dialogues/scene1/firelight.dialogue
msgid "Sálvame, lume de San Xoán,"
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene1/firelight.dialogue
msgid "para que non me trabe caseiro nin can"
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene1/firelight.dialogue
msgid "nin cantos males han…"
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid "Uuuuuuuuuh….. Aaaaaaaaah….. Iiiiiiuuuuuuh……. Aaaaaaaaah…."
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"Iraaaaás ao abrente do dííía\n"
"a aaauga freeesca cataaaaaar"
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"da aaaaauga do paxariiiiño\n"
"que saúúde che haaa de daaaar."
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"Coooooorre, criatura,\n"
"vaaaite lavaaaaar"
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"alááá na foooooonte\n"
"te haaaaaas de lavaaar,"
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"e a freeeeeesca aaaaauga\n"
"deeeesta amañeciiiiida"
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"cooooooor da cereixa\n"
"che teeeen que daaaaar."
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid "Uuuuuuuh….. Aaaaaaah….. Uuuuuuh……. Ooooaaaaah…."
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"Nin apio, nin fiuncho nin pirixel.\n"
"Se atopas nabo de San Pedro\n"
"escapa del."
msgstr ""

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"E, lembra, hoxe como sempre foi:\n"
"Vale máis a pegada de cen mosquitos\n"
"que pé de boi."
msgstr ""

